  "explanation": {
    "id": "DRAFT-NS113@2025-01-24-explanation",
    "kind": "explanation",
    "text": "Held for Legal. NS113 LIS–DUB was cancelled because NS112 never left Dublin in the storm, so EI-NSJ never reached LIS. At STD 13:20Z LIS was calm, and at STA 15:55Z Dublin was 11 kt, after the 02:30–15:00Z window. Whether a knock-on return is extraordinary is a legal question (C-74/19); one question to Legal covers NS113, NS115 and NS117.",
